      "releaseNotes": "Breakout: lock 09:25, entry from 09:30 (higher LTP wins), SL entry-20 / target entry+40, exits at actual LTP and frozen, 09:45 exit fixed. OOBTST and breakout Step 2 progress now follows the high since arming and shows Day High."
    },
